            title: 'HOSE',
            subtitle: 'Card game',
            content: [
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: "HOSE is a mixed poker format: four games in fixed rotation — Hold'em, Omaha (or Omaha/8), Seven-Card Stud, and Eight or Better (Stud High-Low). Played as limit; shared-card games use blinds, stud games use antes and a bring-in. USA; used in tournaments and mixed games.",
              },
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: 'Country/Region of Origin: USA\nTime Period: Early 1900s\nHistorical Development: The game evolved from traditional card games in the region\nCultural Significance: Popular social and family game',
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            title: 'Setup',
            subtitle: 'Table, deck, equipment, and deal',
            content: [
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: 'Minimum Players: 2\nMaximum Players: 6\nOptimal Players: 4\nPartnerships: Optional',
              },
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: 'Type: Standard 52-card deck\nNumber of Decks: 1\nJokers: Not included',
              },
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: 'Standard 52-card deck\nScore sheet (optional)\nTable space',
              },
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: "Cards per player vary by variant: Hold'em 2 hole, Omaha 4 hole, Stud 2 down and 1 up initially then upcards. Dealing clockwise. One complete round of each game (every player deals once) before rotating.",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            title: 'Variations',
            subtitle: 'Known ways this game changes',
            content: [
              {
                type: 'list',
                style: 'unordered',
                items: [
                  {
                    text: "HORSE (5-game): Five-game rotation: adds Razz to HOSE — Hold'em, Omaha/8, Razz, Seven-Card Stud, Eight or Better.",
                  },
                  {
                    text: 'R.O.E. (3-game): Shorter rotation of three variants (e.g. Razz, Omaha, Eight or Better); cycles faster than HOSE.',
                  },
                ],
              },
            ],
